# Julie Sufi

Bridal storefront + admin studio. Read `AGENTS.md` first; product details in `DEVELOPER_HANDOVER.md`. Ignore generic starter `README.md`.

## Hard rules

- CMS content lives in `site_settings.studio_v2` (`lib/studio-store.ts` / `lib/studio-model.ts`), not only legacy tables.
- Never wipe DB content or R2 media on deploy; Save & publish is separate from code.
- Admin auth fail-closed: `ADMIN_PASSCODE` + `ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET` via `lib/admin-auth.ts`.
- `MYSQL_DATABASE` set → MySQL adapter + `public/` media; else D1 + R2.
- Most pages re-export `components/boutique.tsx`; admin UI is `components/studio.tsx`.
- Use pnpm; Node `>=22.13.0`. Do not commit `.dev.vars`.
